        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana MSS005, Letter Box Sleeve</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis sleeve inserts into the door cutout opening to give you a smooth, finished opening. Normally used on 1-3/4\" hollow metal doors but also useful on solid wood doors. Fits in the opening door cut out. Includes mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-MSS005-size.gif?v=1704354750\" width=\"580\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana MSS005 Letter Box Sleeve Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWhile somewhat universal, these are designed to work great with mail slots  <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-heavy-duty-mail-door-deltana-ms0030\"><b>Deltana MS0030</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-mail-slot-with-trim-bezel-deltana-ms211\"><b>Deltana MS211</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/13-1-8-inch-mail-slot-with-interior-flap-deltana-ms212\"><b>Deltana MS212</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the MSS005 Letter Box Sleeve:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: <b>Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Length: 11-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Height: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Depth: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MSS005.pdf?v=1691095373\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana MSS005 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
